  <h2>About ECDC
  </h2>
  <p>ECDC collects, analyses and shares data on more than 50 infectious disease topics. ECDC experts assess risks to Europe and provide guidance to help countries prevent and respond to outbreaks and public health threats.
  </p>    
      

      
